# DESIGN.md §6 -- publication rule.
#
# Nothing under data/ may be committed. data/raw/ holds third-party snapshots
# whose licences grant no redistribution right (Amazon Reviews'23 and the
# Clothing Fit datasets both carry no licence statement at all). data/processed/
# holds working files containing raw review text -- precision_sample.csv in
# particular. Only aggregated results and code are publishable.
data/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.env
.ipynb_checkpoints/
